  Summary by Priority
  
  Fix now: C_echo/Iexit mismatch, endsWith negative-index crash, abortLine bounds, parseAttributeSequence silent error loss, InterruptedException swallowed without
  flag restore.

  Fix soon: C_check_sat_assuming stub (document as unimplemented or implement it), badFormat synchronisation, TypeChecker symbol allocation in hot paths, listenThru
  null/@NonNull contradiction.

  Clean up: all dead-code blocks, the 1-second startup sleep, stale typos.

